#: kmcomposewin.cpp:2784
msgid ""
"<qt>This message could not be signed because you didn't define the OpenPGP "
"key which should be used for signing messages with this identity."
"<br>"
"<br>You can define the OpenPGP key which should be used with the current "
"identity in the identity configuration.</qt>"
